1. The little girl carried a red apple to school.
2. The farmer picked a crisp apple from the tree.
3. She bit into the juicy apple and smiled.
4. The recipe called for one green apple.
5. He tossed the apple into the basket.
6. The teacher handed out an apple to each student.
7. A single apple fell from the branch.
8. The chef sliced the apple into thin pieces.
9. The old story began with a poisoned apple.
10. In the end, the whole family shared one apple. [end of text]


